      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Let's be honest. Brunch is the ultimate weekend event. It’s that perfect sweet spot between a late breakfast and an early lunch, usually involving great food, good company, and zero stress. But figuring out exactly what to wear? That can actually be surprisingly tricky. You don’t want to show up in the stiff clothes you just wore to the office all week, but you also can’t just roll out of bed in your old, faded sweatpants. You need an outfit that hits that exact middle groundâ€”effortless, stylish, and ridiculously comfortable.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00004",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
