      "text": "Grabbing a table outside in the sun? Grab a pair of well-fitted, beige [Men's Shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts). Throw on a brightly colored or white linen shirt, roll the sleeves up past your forearms, and leave it untucked. Finish with some clean white sneakers and your favorite sunglasses. It is completely effortless.",
