      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Just meeting your friends at the local diner? Keep it super simple. A premium, well-fitted [Men's T-Shirt](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-tshirts) layered under an unbuttoned casual cotton overshirt. Pair it with dark trousers or our premium [Men's Joggers](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-joggers) for maximum comfort while eating.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
